>>> EXPECTED ERROR [42501] support may not read users
SELECT email FROM users;
psql:sql/review2/17_security.sql:179: ERROR:  permission denied for table users
<<< actual SQLSTATE: 42501
ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT s;
